 "verdict": "consistent: 77 signs (one surplus) for 76 letters, 20 groups = 20 words, one letter per shape (71/71 repeated); لوقفني is لوقفتي in the cipher (triple arch = ت); ي of متيم not enciphered; ف has two shapes (فتى, لوقفتي)",
 "notes": "Rows 65v l.13 (image 0084_0135) and 66r l.1-5 (image 0084_0136): 12 + 14 + 14 + 14 + 13 + 10 = 77, as the record (its count includes the Λ at the end of 66r l.3). Plain 1.3-1.4x half-line zooms, 2-3x on look-alikes. الجوى runs over the line end: ا ل ج at the end of 66r l.3, و ى at the start of l.4. After ج, at the left end of l.3 (x 640) stands a Λ (= ي elsewhere) and beside it (x 580) a blotted 8-shaped sign: a false start, crossed out; the Λ is kept as a surplus sign, the blotted sign is not counted (this is the \"small sign group beside 66r l.3\" of the record). Keyed as enciphered: لوقفني -> لوقفتي (its fifth sign is the triple arch, ت in قالت x5, لترب, فتى, متيم; ن is the 6-loop in منكرة, من, بمن x3): قالت لترب معها منكرة لوقفتي (\"disapproving of my standing\"). The 9-loop is ق (6), the closed-head ε alif (10), the lam-waw ل (9), and the T و (3)."
